==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Cats in a Box]] to knockback Teacher Bear. Alternatively, using any ranged attackers such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs]]/[[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon]] can suffice. Use meatshields and anything with long range.

